1
00:00:00,220 --> 00:00:02,920
(Penny:)I smell Chinese food.

2
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:05,390
(Sheldon:)It's actually Thai.

3
00:00:05,390 --> 00:00:07,490
(Sheldon:)You're slipping.

4
00:00:07,490 --> 00:00:09,630
(Penny:)Are Leonard and Priya here?

5
00:00:09,630 --> 00:00:11,800
(Sheldon:)They went to Catalina
for the weekend.

6
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:13,130
(Penny:)Oh. Where's Raj?

7
00:00:13,130 --> 00:00:16,040
(Sheldon:)At home, forbidding it.

8
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:17,440
(Penny:)How about Howard?

9
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:18,640
(Sheldon:)I'm given to understand

10
00:00:18,640 --> 00:00:21,840
(Sheldon:)his mother grounded him
for running away.

11
00:00:21,840 --> 00:00:24,980
(Penny:)Oh, okay.

12
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:28,820
(Penny:)Well, I guess it's just
the two of us, huh?

13
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:31,080
(Sheldon:)Actually, it's
the three of us.

14
00:00:31,090 --> 00:00:33,390
(Penny:)AMY
What up, bestie?

15
00:00:35,290 --> 00:00:36,620
(Amy(on webcam):)Good news.

16
00:00:36,620 --> 00:00:39,090
(Amy(on webcam):)Thanks to you, I was able
to make a rhesus monkey cry

17
00:00:39,090 --> 00:00:41,260
(Amy(on webcam):)like a disgraced televangelist.

18
00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:44,100
(Bernadette:)Great.

19
00:00:44,100 --> 00:00:45,370
(Amy:)So, you feeling better?

20
00:00:45,370 --> 00:00:46,470
(Howard:)Not really.

21
00:00:46,470 --> 00:00:49,100
(Amy:)Sheldon, you have
a guest who's upset.

22
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:51,100
(Sheldon:)Right. I'll make tea.

23
00:00:51,110 --> 00:00:53,660
(Penny:)- Sweetie, it's okay. I don't want tea.
- I'm sorry. It's not optional.

